This integrated approach ensures that each service maintains its hexagonal boundaries. The core logic (Axon aggregates) remains focused on business rules, interacting with other services only through well-defined ports. Adapters handle the technical complexities of communication (HTTP, Kafka) and resilience (Resilience4j), making the system highly modular, testable, and adaptable to changes in underlying technologies or external service behaviors.

